58	Wellness Academy_chunk_0019	Our understanding of the \nfunctional and structural \nchanges in an aging brain  \nis continually expanding. Several factors are \nimplicated in the aging  \nof the brain.\n\n14\nWellness Academy | The Need for Active Nutrition\nDISCUSSION \nNutrient requirements change throughout the life \ncycle. Nutrition and physical activity are two of the \nmajor determinants of overall health and quality \nof life that play an important role in managing \nphysiological and cognitive aging at the cellular level. \nThe association between physical health and mental \nhealth has been well established, and there is plenty \nof evidence of the positive short- and long-term \nimpact of a balanced nutrition and regular physical \nactivity on both. Robust physical and mental health \nare a great defense against the changes in an aging \nbrain. There is a critical need to better understand \nearly life interventions to improve overall health and \nextend health-span. Smart supplemental strategies \nare an excellent way to compensate for nutrient \ninadequacies throughout life. They can also provide \nadditional benefits to improve energy availability and \nrecovery for intense trainings. There is accumulating \nevidence suggesting how a healthy lifestyle in early \nyears is critical to maintaining health and curtailing \nthe risk of age-related disorders later in life. Cognitive \ndevelopment early in life and cognitive preservation \nlater in life are essential for overall health. Current \nresearch highlights the importance of an active lifestyle \nand incorporation of healthy nutrients in slowing \nage-related cognitive decline. Personalized nutrition \nmay have the potential to optimize physiological and \ncognitive health based on individual genetic variability. \nWhile food allergies, limitations and intolerances are not \nnoted here, a more holistic approach to active nutrition \nis necessary throughout life for health prosperity. \nUnderstanding the relationship between diet, physical \nactivity, stress and mood will help optimize overall \nhealth, well-being and immunity. \nTour the Wellness Academy for valuable insights and \nresources to help you on your new health and  \nwellness product development journey	[0.007648974,0.007843492,-0.027534466,-0.0060027493,-0.030545274,-0.061302572,-0.025932066,-0.0021073536,0.014765843,-0.04045611,0.031720556,-0.04306313,-0.10061961,0.005085072,-0.0057103503,-0.021361157,-0.020430127,0.009527709,-0.053340983,0.014130035,-0.020216445,-0.021452082,0.03881362,0.018176924,0.022466887,0.048550665,-0.014183408,-0.0023600326,0.02645477,0.055654906,-0.0078672245,-0.035162807,-0.013449687,0.0029820267,0.0231939,0.00043547282,0.029362252,-0.052175056,-0.021524617,0.0346534,-0.0024486072,-0.0220849,0.004436167,-0.039448526,0.005731891,-0.016663007,-0.0033104038,0.0019344996,-0.005522906,-0.080878824,-0.009684732,-0.0071647796,0.018303774,-0.010195069,-0.005034999,0.0517604,-0.036016982,0.034210525,-0.03952493,-0.015289824,0.015007244,0.0047584386,-0.0044587017,-0.032294724,-0.031064345,0.03795178,0.0035707934,0.012642845,-0.0028299778,-0.062284134,-0.009615211,-0.016099123,-0.017680587,-0.012677861,-0.032762825,0.018912975,-0.008791047,-0.012257465,0.0268949,-0.0006029573,-0.014154587,0.0043287356,-0.015656983,-0.020422222,0.026712442,-0.0014681678,-0.014129911,0.038375925,0.04473204,-0.009004087,-0.024086487,-0.025199715,0.019941065,-0.03632913,-0.002348623,-0.010500273,-0.03845896,-0.06338349,0.041045446,-0.0006697514,0.015279916,0.019664727,-0.016166952,-0.0019545418,0.021974247,0.008519995,-0.012244283,-0.0063982937,0.028398909,-0.006320094,0.037146956,0.012458402,0.016528752,0.031224193,0.012401138,-0.019154752,0.029738693,-0.04928429,0.037625242,0.020097334,0.025041988,0.017409652,0.03153935,-0.0200292,-0.010087434,0.026330931,0.087834485,-0.01004545,-0.044150934,0.00750249,-0.0019882133,-0.027408658,-0.08788518,-0.027074642,-0.02606086,0.016223148,0.024053289,0.06282885