41	Wellness Academy_chunk_0002	skeletal health, cognitive health and metabolic \nhealth across the lifespan (Koehler and Drenowatz, \n2019). There are a number of factors that influence \nphysical and mental health at each life stage.\n\nA decade long survey conducted in the U.S. on  \n26,283 adults over the age of 19 years found that that \n45% of the population does not meet the estimated \naverage requirement for four out of five key immune \nnutrients: vitamins A,C,D,E and zinc. This gap can easily \nbe abridged by regular use dietary supplements (Reider \net al., 2020). Another survey acknowledged risk of \nnutrient deficiency in almost one third of the  \nU.S. population (Bird et al., 2017)\nThere are several factors that influence nutrient  \nneeds. These include age, gender, genetic  \nconditions, physical activity, etc.	[0.028418416,0.02540963,-0.042771302,-0.025754994,-0.03194905,-0.06109681,0.013006889,-0.02061838,-0.023342447,-0.034496725,-0.013029071,-0.009453753,-0.097876914,-0.021427175,0.02324204,-0.005537368,-0.039955616,-0.010924811,-0.08279163,-0.0066869683,-0.029531937,0.011337461,0.029434826,0.010187746,0.0013395919,0.0137491645,-0.01323589,0.012290508,-0.0059610493,0.053731885,-0.03461873,-0.033933233,0.058093287,0.0062972875,0.0024812315,-0.00402802,0.00043033843,-0.0827656,-0.03512464,0.036784153,0.00869952,-0.044932697,0.010752365,-0.03149936,0.010889533,-0.02485641,0.028872687,-0.011886046,0.020695386,-0.036953196,-0.013075025,0.014698178,0.031493805,-0.021309378,0.006838486,0.021842651,-0.024362037,0.045317966,-0.036320187,-0.015565676,-0.012028654,0.009492614,-0.023704544,-0.03355589,0.023303717,0.014061792,0.013577297,-0.011437415,-0.014252447,-0.06610127,0.012011705,0.024987828,0.0061376365,-0.027196178,-0.03602148,-0.015866088,-0.004483226,-0.0070858067,0.0168575,0.02362348,0.008977824,-0.008656636,0.0117948735,-0.01833338,-0.026938673,6.953287e-05,-0.005385351,-0.010264116,0.004845474,0.0023716197,-0.014026145,-0.03495864,0.02920837,-