49	Wellness Academy_chunk_0010	000 days \nof life, starting conception through 2 years of age are \na crucial for healthy growth, development and life \n(Beluska-Turkan et al., 2019). During the same time, \nbrain development is rapid.\n\nNutritional deficiencies \nduring this phase not only have physiological impact, \nbut also affect brain development including cognitive \nand emotional processes that follow (Black, 2018). It \nis considered as an important period to implement \ninterventions to assure healthy nutrition and lifestyle for \nlifelong benefits. Increased nutritional demands during \npregnancy, lactation and early life make these groups \nmost vulnerable to micronutrient deficiencies. Physical exercise has many health benefits during \npregnancy, aiding in stress management both during \npregnancy and postpartum (Guo et al., 2021). Type of \nexercise during pregnancy has long been a topic of \nOptimal nutrition prior  \nto conception and during \npregnancy is important  \nto meet the body’s  \naltered demands.	[0.0010491735,0.034472283,-0.03180712,0.027718151,-0.049267307,0.009022211,-0.015308983,0.009082419,0.009264024,-0.017724143,-0.021126023,-0.010615632,-0.07933662,0.00590869,-0.007979012,-0.022415252,-0.018232502,-0.011339467,-0.037355922,0.028549032,0.021569438,-0.008343863,0.055181425,0.030252391,-0.028770553,0.030621966,-0.024836486,0.022399437,0.027008766,0.014771412,-0.012683756,-0.0036280574,0.015684003,-0.020750392,0.022235269,-0.025841493,0.004561106,-0.05562713,-0.024671273,0.012577623,-0.017939147,0.020774737,0.023950178,-0.0131123,0.016703365,-0.0358551,-0.031365693,-0.008876418,0.00905335,-0.038449347,0.008140015,-0.0052513205,0.022354688,-0.023545796,0.016930258,0.03183909,-0.016180571,-0.029911038,-0.05069521,-0.0141737545,-0.020710422,0.024737906,0.0025679362,-0.030377243,-0.004443741,0.008428884,0.033136353,-0.029634777,-0.022575427,-0.05545094,0.007395425,0.022059452,0.008784693,-0.03758068,-0.04130767,0.021588972,-0.030689875,0